verify Roadmap010Verification kind cross-cutting:
  label "0.1.0 API 并发配置与标注"
  claim "Each API owns a bounded concurrency setting defaulting to eight; parallel completion never corrupts photo identity, task state or persistent history."
  verifies InferenceConfigurationFieldPromise,AndroidPhotoWallFieldPromise,ConfigureAndroidModelFunctionPromise,AnnotateAndroidPhotosFunctionPromise
  methods unit,integration,review
  scenario "per-profile settings and legacy defaults":
    covers InferenceConfiguration.bounded_concurrency,InferenceConfiguration.profile_compatibility,ConfigureAndroidModel.card
    given "New profiles, encrypted legacy single and multi-profile files without concurrency, different saved concurrency values and unsaved drafts."
    when "Loading, changing concurrency, saving, cancelling, rotating, switching, relaunching and testing a connection."
    then "The default is eight, selectable values are one through eight, profiles remain independent and encrypted, legacy bytes stay intact until explicit save, and a connection test sends one request."
  scenario "bounded and out-of-order annotation":
    covers AnnotateAndroidPhotos.bounded_parallelism,AnnotateAndroidPhotos.scope,AnnotateAndroidPhotos.invalid_output,AndroidPhotoWall.annotation_progress,AndroidPhotoWall.honest_eta
    given "More pending photos than workers, selected and unselected photos, historical annotations, and controlled delayed, failed and malformed API responses."
    when "Running at one, two and eight workers, completing requests out of order, editing the active API while running, or destroying the Activity."
    then "Observed overlap reaches the chosen bound but never exceeds it; only the snapshot scope is sent, each valid result attaches to the correct photo, errors preserve history, all active thumbnails and counts remain accurate, and cancellation starts no further work or late writes."
    guard "Schema 8, Python behavior/version, encrypted credentials, grants and existing rows remain intact. Only fresh isolated builds are packaged, and real-device delivery uses an existing-package adb install -r with before/after state verification."
  evidence "Promise, JVM, emulator API/settings/progress regressions, lint and API-only checks; xspark Qwen max-num-seqs=8 plus graph batches 1/2/4/8 with preserved original config, real eight-request gateway overlap and rollback if readiness or inference fails."
  fail "Concurrency leaks between profiles, exceeds its bound, loses or misattributes results, overwrites history, or disrupts unrelated server services or phone data."
